#: includes/class-mailer.php:17
msgid ""
"Hi {name},\n"
"\n"
"thank you for signing up for \"{spot}\".\n"
"\n"
"Date: {date}\n"
"Time: {time}\n"
"Location: {location}\n"
"\n"
"We will send you a reminder beforehand.\n"
"Want to change your details, or can't make it? Change or cancel your registration here, so someone else can take over:\n"
"{manage_url}\n"
"\n"
"Calendar: {calendar_url}\n"
"\n"
"{stats}"
msgstr ""
"Hallo {name},\n"
"\n"
"vielen Dank, dass du dich für „{spot}“ eingetragen hast.\n"
"\n"
"Datum: {date}\n"
"Uhrzeit: {time}\n"
"Ort: {location}\n"
"\n"
"Wir schicken dir vorher eine Erinnerung.\n"
"Du möchtest etwas ändern oder kannst doch nicht? Hier kannst du deine Anmeldung ändern oder dich austragen, damit jemand anderes übernehmen kann:\n"
"{manage_url}\n"
"\n"
"Kalender: {calendar_url}\n"
"\n"
"{stats}"

#: includes/class-mailer.php:21
msgid "Reminder: {spot} on {date}"
msgstr "Erinnerung: {spot} am {date}"

#: includes/class-mailer.php:22
msgid ""
"Hi {name},\n"
"\n"
"a friendly reminder that you are signed up for \"{spot}\".\n"
"\n"
"Date: {date}\n"
"Time: {time}\n"
"Location: {location}\n"
"\n"
"Can't make it after all? Change or cancel your registration here:\n"
"{manage_url}\n"
"\n"
"Calendar: {calendar_url}"
msgstr ""
"Hallo {name},\n"
"\n"
"eine freundliche Erinnerung: Du bist für „{spot}“ eingetragen.\n"
"\n"
"Datum: {date}\n"
"Uhrzeit: {time}\n"
"Ort: {location}\n"
"\n"
"Du kannst doch nicht? Hier kannst du deine Anmeldung ändern oder dich austragen:\n"
"{manage_url}\n"
"\n"
"Kalender: {calendar_url}"

#: includes/class-mailer.php:26
msgid "Cancelled: {spot} on {date}"
msgstr "Abgemeldet: {spot} am {date}"

#: includes/class-mailer.php:27
msgid ""
"Hi {name},\n"
"\n"
"your registration for \"{spot}\" on {date} ({time}) has been cancelled.\n"
"\n"
"Calendar: {calendar_url}"
msgstr ""
"Hallo {name},\n"
"\n"
"deine Anmeldung für „{spot}“ am {date} ({time}) wurde storniert.\n"
"\n"
"Kalender: {calendar_url}"

#: includes/class-mailer.php:31
msgid "Does not take place: {spot} on {date}"
msgstr "Fällt aus: {spot} am {date}"

#: includes/class-mailer.php:32
msgid ""
"Hi {name},\n"
"\n"
"\"{spot}\" on {date} ({time}) will not take place. Your registration has been removed – there is nothing you need to do.\n"
"\n"
"Calendar: {calendar_url}"
msgstr ""
"Hallo {name},\n"
"\n"
"„{spot}“ am {date} ({time}) fällt aus. Deine Anmeldung wurde entfernt – du musst nichts weiter tun.\n"
"\n"
"Kalender: {calendar_url}"

#: includes/class-mailer.php:36
msgid "Your duties at {site}"
msgstr "Deine Dienste bei {site}"

#: includes/class-mailer.php:37
msgid ""
"Hi {name},\n"
"\n"
"you asked for an overview of your registrations. These are your upcoming duties:\n"
"\n"
"{list}\n"
"\n"
"Use the link below a duty to change or cancel that registration.\n"
"\n"
"Calendar: {calendar_url}\n"
"\n"
"If you did not request this email, you can simply ignore it."
msgstr ""
"Hallo {name},\n"
"\n"
"du hast eine Übersicht deiner Anmeldungen angefordert. Das sind deine kommenden Dienste:\n"
"\n"
"{list}\n"
"\n"
"Über den Link unter einem Dienst kannst du diese Anmeldung ändern oder dich austragen.\n"
"\n"
"Kalender: {calendar_url}\n"
"\n"
"Falls du diese E-Mail nicht angefordert hast, kannst du sie einfach ignorieren."

#: includes/class-mailer.php:41
msgid "{count} duties still need people ({week})"
msgstr "Unterbesetzte Dienste: {count} ({week})"

#: includes/class-mailer.php:42
msgid ""
"Hello,\n"
"\n"
"the following duties for {week} have not reached their minimum number of people yet:\n"
"\n"
"{list}\n"
"\n"
"Manage the schedule: {admin_url}\n"
"Calendar: {calendar_url}"
msgstr ""
"Hallo,\n"
"\n"
"folgende Dienste im Zeitraum {week} haben ihre Mindestzahl an Personen noch nicht erreicht:\n"
"\n"
"{list}\n"
"\n"
"Dienstplan verwalten: {admin_url}\n"
"Kalender: {calendar_url}"

#: includes/class-mailer.php:46
msgid "{location}: plan for the next {weeks} weeks"
msgstr "{location}: Plan für die nächsten {weeks} Wochen"

#: includes/class-mailer.php:47
msgid ""
"Hello everyone,\n"
"\n"
"here is the duty plan for {week}.\n"
"\n"
"{open}\n"
"\n"
"{covered}\n"
"\n"
"Sign up or check the calendar: {calendar_url}\n"
"\n"
"Thank you for keeping our building running!"
msgstr ""
"Hallo zusammen,\n"
"\n"
"hier ist der Dienstplan für {week}.\n"
"\n"
"{open}\n"
"\n"
"{covered}\n"
"\n"
"Eintragen oder im Kalender nachschauen: {calendar_url}\n"
"\n"
"Danke, dass ihr unser Haus am Laufen haltet!"

